* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
# frozen git bundle（基准语料，ADR-0026/#33）：必须单列且写在本目录——根 .gitattributes 的 `*.{...}` 花括号
# 是无效语法（git 不展开 brace，实测落 text: auto），且深层目录规则优先于浅层，故本条只能放这里。
*.bundle binary -text
# Generated artifacts (D-140): trust source = rebuild-diff CI guard, not human diff review
dist/** linguist-generated gitlab-generated -diff
